<section image-layout="blank" id="ijzyGjGFnA" vertical-align="center" background-color="heading"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="qtRpEHi_lu"><p role="eyebrow">Committee decision</p><h1 font-size="38pt">Turn unknowns into priced evidence</h1><h3 role="subheading">Approve a 90-day portfolio screen with one investment-committee gate.</h3><grid marker="number" marker-size="large" marker-style="solid" marker-shape="circle" marker-position="above" marker-align="center" marker-straddle="true" spacing="medium" padding-top="28pt"><grid-item id="lMChLylpDx" background-color="surface" text-color="#171A1F" colspan="15"><p role="eyebrow">Days 0–30</p><h4>Prioritize assets</h4><p font-size="18pt">Screen refrigeration, cooling, foam, fire suppression and process dependence.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="IBibzDdmbX" background-color="surface" text-color="#171A1F" colspan="15"><p role="eyebrow">Days 31–60</p><h4>Classify substances</h4><p font-size="18pt">Assign ODS, HFC, lower-impact substitute or unknown; request missing inventories.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="YItiKsKlfe" background-color="surface" text-color="#171A1F" colspan="15"><p role="eyebrow">Days 61–90</p><h4>Price the cases</h4><p font-size="18pt">Apply issuer timing, contracts and financing capacity to the illustrative stresses.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="gadtcSHIpc" background-color="surface" text-color="#171A1F" colspan="15"><p role="eyebrow">IC gate</p><h4>Choose the action</h4><p font-size="18pt">Underwrite, reserve + engage or defer; set the owner and reporting cadence.</p></grid-item></grid><spacer size="12pt"></spacer><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="tUjVXhilJU" background-color="palette-2" padding="12pt 16pt"><h3>No substance map, no confident transition valuation.</h3></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>